    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDunbur Lodge is a substantial detached coastal residence comprising an impressive eleven bedroom main house together with a separate detached three bedroom mews residence, all set on mature private grounds just moments from Wicklow Town and the coastline. Originally designed and constructed to Bord Fáilte guesthouse specification, the property offers exceptionally flexible accommodation including generous reception areas, commercial kitchen facilities and extensive ancillary space. Vacant and ready for immediate occupation, Dunbur Lodge presents a rare opportunity for a purchaser seeking a large private residence, guest accommodation business, staff accommodation, wellness retreat or tourism based venture in one of Wicklow's most scenic coastal settings.\n\nInternally, the property offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout including a large dining room, reception area, living room, sunroom, conservatory and commercial style kitchen together with eleven ensuite guest bedrooms arranged over two floors. The separate detached mews residence within the grounds provides a further three bedrooms alongside additional living accommodation, making it ideally suited for staff quarters, extended family use or further guest overflow. Outside, the gardens are mature, private and beautifully established with split level patio areas, pergolas, extensive planting and a striking waterlily pond creating a peaceful and unique setting rarely found so close to town. While the property would benefit from modernisation, the scale, layout and versatility on offer here are genuinely difficult to replicate in today's market.\n\nDunbur Lodge enjoys an exceptional position in Dunbur Lower, just a short stroll from Wicklow's iconic lighthouses, coastline and coastal walks, while Wicklow Town centre, harbour, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, schools and transport links are all within easy reach. The location places the property approximately one hour south of Dublin and just minutes from the M11, making it highly accessible for domestic and international visitors alike. The surrounding area is renowned for tourism, outdoor pursuits and corporate retreats with nearby attractions including Brittas Bay, Wicklow Golf Club, Glendalough and the wider Garden County."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Substantial detached coastal residence</li><li> Eleven bedroom main house with extensive reception accommodation</li><li> Separate detached three bedroom mews residence</li><li> Originally constructed to Bord Fáilte guesthouse specification</li><li> B3 BER Rating</li><li> Commercial style kitchen and dining facilities</li><li> Sunroom, conservatory and multiple reception areas</li><li> Mature private landscaped gardens with waterlily pond and patio areas</li><li> Vacant and ready for immediate occupation</li><li> Exceptional flexibility for residential, hospitality or tourism use</li><li> Walking distance to Wicklow Town, coastline and Wicklow Lighthouses</li><li> Easy access to the M11 and approximately one hour from Dublin City Centre</ul>"
      },
